{"ref":"BDB, גָּלוּת","hw":"גָּלוּת","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גָּלוּת</span></big>  <strong>n.f. exile</strong>—<a data-ref=\"Isaiah 20:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.20.4\">Is 20:4</a> + 9 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּלֻת</span> <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:20\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.20\">Ob 20:20</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּלוּתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 45:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.45.13\">Is 45:13</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּלוּתֵינוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 33:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.33.21\">Ez 33:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:1\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.1\">40:1</a> (Qameṣ unchangeable);—<br><strong>1.</strong>  abs. <em>exile</em>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 25:27\" href=\"/II_Kings.25.27\">2 K 25:27</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 52:31\" href=\"/Jeremiah.52.31\">Je 52:31</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 1:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.1.2\">Ez 1:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 33:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.33.21\">33:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:1\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.1\">40:1</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  coll. <em>exiles</em> <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:6\" href=\"/Amos.1.6\">Am 1:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:9\" href=\"/Amos.1.9\">9</a> <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:20\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.20\">Ob 20</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גלות כושׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 20:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.20.4\">Is 20:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גלות יהודה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 24:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.24.5\">Je 24:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 28:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.28.4\">28:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 29:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.29.22\">29:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 40:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.40.1\">40:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גלותי ישׁלח</span> <em>he shall let my exiles</em> (<em>Yahweh’s</em>) <em>go free</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 45:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.45.13\">Is 45:13</a>; vid. Lag<sup>Arm. Stud. § 445</sup>.","next":"BDB, גִּלָּיוֹן","prev":"BDB, גּוֹלָה"}